{"page":210,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:15","surah":10,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَاتُنَا بَيِّنَـٰتٍ ۙ قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ لِقَآءَنَا ٱئْتِ بِقُرْءَانٍ غَيْرِ هَـٰذَآ أَوْ بَدِّلْهُ ۚ قُلْ مَا يَكُونُ لِىٓ أَنْ أُبَدِّلَهُۥ مِن تِلْقَآئِ نَفْسِىٓ ۖ إِنْ أَتَّبِعُ إِلَّا مَا يُوحَىٰٓ إِلَىَّ ۖ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ إِنْ عَصَيْتُ رَبِّى عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Our clear revelations are recited to them, those who do not expect to meet with Us say, ‘Bring [us] a different Quran, or change it.’ [Prophet], say, ‘It is not for me to change it of my own accord; I only follow what is revealed to me, for I fear the torment of an awesome Day, if I were to disobey my Lord.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"are recited","transliteration":"tut'lā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَاتُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātunā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۙ","en_gloss":"(as) clear proofs","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَرْجُونَ","en_gloss":"hope","transliteration":"yarjūna","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِقَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"(for the) meeting (with) Us","transliteration":"liqāanā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱئْتِ","en_gloss":"Bring us","transliteration":"i'ti","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِقُرْءَانٍ","en_gloss":"a Quran","transliteration":"biqur'ānin","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"غَيْرِ","en_gloss":"other (than)","transliteration":"ghayri","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَدِّلْهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"change it","transliteration":"baddil'hu","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَكُونُ","en_gloss":"(it) is","transliteration":"yakūnu","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لِىٓ","en_gloss":"for me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":22,"ar":"أُبَدِّلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"I change it","transliteration":"ubaddilahu","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":24,"ar":"تِلْقَآئِ","en_gloss":"my own accord","transliteration":"til'qāi","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":25,"ar":"نَفْسِىٓ ۖ","en_gloss":"my own accord","transliteration":"nafsī","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":26,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":27,"ar":"أَتَّبِعُ","en_gloss":"I follow","transliteration":"attabiʿu","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":28,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":29,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":30,"ar":"يُوحَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"is revealed","transliteration":"yūḥā","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":31,"ar":"إِلَىَّ ۖ","en_gloss":"to me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":32,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":33,"ar":"أَخَافُ","en_gloss":"[I] fear","transliteration":"akhāfu","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":34,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"10:15"},{"pos":35,"ar":"عَصَيْتُ","en_gloss":"I were to di