iteration":"faqad","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَبِثْتُ","en_gloss":"I have stayed","transliteration":"labith'tu","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عُمُرًۭا","en_gloss":"a lifetime","transliteration":"ʿumuran","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَبْلِهِۦٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"Then will not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you use reason","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"10:16"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:16"}]},{"verse_key":"10:17","surah":10,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّنِ ٱفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًا أَوْ كَذَّبَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who could be more wicked than someone who invents lies against God or denies His revelations? The guilty will never prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"So who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more wrong","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّنِ","en_gloss":"than he who","transliteration":"mimmani","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"invents","transliteration":"if'tarā","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَذِبًا","en_gloss":"a lie","transliteration":"kadhiban","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"denies","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"biāyātihi","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُفْلِحُ","en_gloss":"will succeed","transliteration":"yuf'liḥu","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","en_gloss":"the criminals","transliteration":"l-muj'rimūna","verse_key":"10:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:17"}]},{"verse_key":"10:18","surah":10,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَعْبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا يَضُرُّهُمْ وَلَا يَنفَعُهُمْ وَيَقُولُونَ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ شُفَعَـٰٓؤُنَا عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ قُلْ أَتُنَبِّـُٔونَ ٱللَّهَ بِمَا لَا يَعْلَمُ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَلَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ عَمَّا يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They worship alongside God things that can neither harm nor benefit them, and say, ‘These are our intercessors with God.’ Say, ‘Do you think you can tell God about something He knows not to exist in the heavens or earth? Glory be to Him! He is far above the partner-gods they associate with Him!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"And they worship","transliteration":"wayaʿbudūna","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"other than","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"that (which)","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَضُرُّهُمْ","en_gloss":"harm them","transliteration":"yaḍurruhum","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"